---
import X2PostPromo from "@/components/blog/X2PostPromo.astro";
import PageLayout from "@/layouts/Base.astro";

const meta = {
	description: "关于 Moatkon 和这个博客",
	title: "About",
};
---

<PageLayout meta={meta}>
	<section class="mb-10">
		<X2PostPromo />
	</section>
	<div class="prose prose-sm max-w-none">
		<h1 class="title mb-6">About</h1>
		<p>Hi, 我是一名软件开发工程师。建设这个博客的目的是为了记录和思考。</p>

		<h2>Moatkon's</h2>
		<ul role="list">
			<li>
				博客开源：<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://github.com/moatkon/blog"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">GitHub</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				了解我的职业生涯：<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://resume.moatkon.com"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">简历</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				了解我平时都干些什么：<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://moatkon.com"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">Moatkon</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				了解我订阅了哪些服务：<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://subs.moatkon.com"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">Subs</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				逛逛我做的内容社区：<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://x2post.com"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">X2Post</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				通过其他渠道联系我：<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://links.moatkon.com"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">Links</a
				>
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Likes</h2>
		<ul role="list">
			<li>
				<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://moatkon.com/music/piano/study/"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">音乐</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://moatkon.com/share/movie/"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">电影</a
				>
			</li>
			<li>
				<a
					class="cactus-link inline-block"
					href="https://moatkon.com/english/"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					target="_blank">英语</a
				>
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Thanks</h2>
		<p>
			本网站基于<a
				class="cactus-link"
				href="https://github.com/chrismwilliams/astro-cactus"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				target="_blank">Astro Cactus</a
			>构建。
		</p>

		<h2>Support</h2>
		<p>If you enjoy what I do, please support me on:</p>
		<p>
			<a
				class="inline-block"
				href="https://ko-fi.com/moatkon"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				target="_blank"
			>
				<img
					src="/ko-fi.png"
					alt="Support me on Ko-fi"
					class="h-8 w-auto"
					width="1475"
					height="402"
				/>
			</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</PageLayout>
